---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How builtwithjon.com collects, uses, and protects your information."
>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="legal-updated">Last Updated: August 5, 2026</p>

    <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
    <p>
      This Privacy Policy explains how Jonathan Malkin ("I," "me," "my") collects, uses, and
      protects information when you visit builtwithjon.com (the "Site").
    </p>
    <p>The Site is a personal blog and portfolio. I aim to collect as little data as possible.</p>

    <h2>2. Information I Collect</h2>

    <h3>2.1 Information You Provide</h3>
    <p>
      <strong>Form information</strong>: If you subscribe to my newsletter, contact me, request a
      review, join a waitlist, or submit a scorecard, I collect the information you provide. This
      may include your email address, name, company, message details, and selected form responses.
    </p>

    <h3>2.2 Information Collected Automatically</h3>
    <p>
      <strong>Analytics data</strong>: I use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which collects page views,
      referrers, browser type, and approximate location. Cloudflare Web Analytics is privacy-focused:
      it does not use cookies, does not track individual visitors across sites, and does not collect
      personal information. Data is aggregated and not tied to individual users. The Site also records
      first-party interaction events (such as button clicks and form submissions), used only to understand
      which pages and actions work. When you arrive through a tagged campaign link, the Site keeps a compact
      first-touch attribution value in local browser storage for up to 30 days and attaches it to those events
      and any form you submit.
    </p>

    <h2>3. How I Use Information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Newsletter</strong>: To send you articles and updates when new content is published.
        You can unsubscribe at any time using the link in any email.</li>
      <li><strong>Forms and requests</strong>: To respond to your message, send the requested
        resource, follow up about a review, or process your waitlist details.</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics</strong>: To understand overall traffic patterns and improve the Site.
        I do not track individual visitors.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>I use the following services to operate the Site:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Forms and email</strong>: Forms are processed by our Cloudflare Worker. Email delivery
        and subscriber management use <a href="https://www.sender.net/privacy-policy/">Sender</a>.
        Form submissions are stored first-party in a private Cloudflare KV namespace for up to two years
        so a third-party outage does not lose your request.</li>
      <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong>: Website hosting (Cloudflare Pages) and analytics
        (Cloudflare Web Analytics).
        <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare's Privacy Policy</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>I do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with anyone else.</p>

    <h2>5. Cookies</h2>
    <p>The Site does not use cookies. Cloudflare Web Analytics is cookieless by design. Local browser
      storage is used only for the 30-day first-touch attribution described above.</p>

    <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Email addresses and form submissions</strong>: First-party form records are retained for
        up to two years while needed to send the requested resource, respond to the request, or keep your newsletter subscription active.
        Newsletter addresses are removed from the newsletter upon unsubscribe.</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics</strong>: Cloudflare retains aggregated analytics data per their retention
        policies. No individual visitor data is stored by me.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Your Rights and Choices</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Unsubscribe</strong>: Use the unsubscribe link in any newsletter email.</li>
      <li><strong>Access or delete</strong>: Contact me to request access to or deletion of your
        email address.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      If you are a California resident (CCPA) or Texas resident (TDPSA), you have additional rights
      to know, correct, and delete personal information. I do not sell personal data.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      The Site is intended for a general audience. I do not knowingly collect information from
      children under 13.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      I may update this Privacy Policy by posting a revised version and updating the
      "Last Updated" date.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Jonathan Malkin<br />
      Email: <a href="mailto:jonathan@builtwithjon.com">jonathan@builtwithjon.com</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
